Error [jet.JobNameConflict]: `lint` is reserved by Jet's command line
  --> tests/ui/E0928_job_reserved_name.jet:9:1
    |
  9 | #Job lint: fn() {
    | ^^^^
 Why: `lint` is a Jet command; top-level jobs must have distinct names
 Fix: Rename the job, e.g. `#Job fn lint_all()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0928

